3. **Compliance** — check what your jurisdiction requires (e.g., GDPR in Europe, CCPA/CPRA in California). Screen recording and keylogging can trigger additional requirements.
4. **End-user agreement** — employees should know the scope of what you're tracking and have a way to opt out.

